n begin="3:32.613" end="3:32.753">no </span><span begin="3:32.753" end="3:33.273">se</span><span begin="3:33.273" end="3:33.753">kai </span><span begin="3:33.753" end="3:34.533">tsutsun</span><span begin="3:34.533" end="3:34.863">de</span><span begin="3:34.863" end="3:35.683">ku</span></text><text for="L40"><span begin="3:35.973" end="3:36.753">nee </span><span begin="3:37.193" end="3:37.813">koi </span><span begin="3:37.813" end="3:38.883">yo </span><span begin="3:39.113" end="3:39.623">zut</span><span begin="3:39.623" end="3:42.183">to </span><span begin="3:42.543" end="3:42.733">to</span><span begin="3:42.733" end="3:43.143">ke</span><span begin="3:43.143" end="3:43.533">nai </span><span begin="3:43.533" end="3:47.103">de</span></text><text for="L41"><span begin="3:50.301" end="3:50.959">ki e</span><span begin="3:50.959" end="3:51.339">nai </span><span begin="3:51.339" end="3:53.779">de</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>MIREI</songwriter><songwriter>SoichiroK</songwriter><songwriter>TomoLow</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">白色的呵气 红砖铺就的路</text><text for="L2">围巾掩映着你的侧脸</text><text for="L3">冻僵的指尖也好</text><text for="L4">初落的雪花也好</text><text for="L5">都是彼此依偎的理由</text><text for="L6">街头灯火一盏盏闪亮的季节</text><text for="L7">多想相信这是命中注定</text><text for="L8">你心里惦念的人又是谁？</text><text for="L9">求你 求你来到我身边</text><text for="L10">握住我的手 拥我入怀</text><text for="L11">请传达这难以启齿 难以启齿的心意</text><text for="L12">用这冰冷 冰冷的雪</text><text for="L13">将两人的世界封存</text><text for="L14">让这份爱恋再也不消逝</text><text for="L15">每当大衣的袖口轻轻相触</text><text for="L16">无法牵起的手让人心急</text><text for="L17">仅仅是目光交汇 便怦然心动</text><text for="L18">我试着让心跳平息</text><text for="L19">雪花纷纷飘落 又悄然融化</text><text for="L20">无论幸福还是遗憾</text><text for="L21">都想与你一同感受 直到永远</text><text for="L22">只要与你在一起 一切的一切</text><text for="L23">满城都是闪闪发亮的礼物</text><text for="L24">不够 远远不够 只说谢谢还不够</text><text for="L25">这冰冷 冰冷的雪</text><text for="L26">即使终有一天会融化</text><text for="L27">呐 请不要离开</text><text for="L28">每次见面都想更了解你</text><text for="L29">越是了解 就越是喜欢</text><text for="L30">喜欢上你便渴望拥有 这任性的心</text><text for="L31">当我回握住你的手</text><text for="L32">当目光不经意间相遇</text><text for="L33">心一直隐隐作痛 再也无法回头</text><text for="L34">心里满满都是你</text><text for="L35">求你 求你靠近我身边</text><text for="L36">牵起我的手 将我抱紧</text><text for="L37">请传达这难以诉说 难以诉说的爱</text><text for="L38">这冰冷 冰冷的雪</text><text for="L39">正轻轻包围两人的世界</text><text for="L40">呐 愿这份恋情永不消融</text><text for="L41">请不要消逝</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:53.779"><div begin="0:17.342" end="3:53.779"><p begin="0:17.342" end="0:20.879" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.342" end="0:18.002">白</span><span begin="0:18.002" end="0:18.152">い</span><span begin="0:18.152" end="0:18.482">吐</span><span begin="0:18.482" end="0:18.932">息</span> <span begin="0:19.212" end="0:19.492">赤</span><span begin="0:19.492" end="0:19.672">い</span><span begin="0:19.672" end="0:20.132">煉</span><span begin="0:20.132" end="0:20.879">瓦道</span></p><p begin="0:21.142" end="0:24.732" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.142" end="0:21.312">マ</span><span begin="0:21.312" end="0:21.602">フ</span><span begin="0:21.602" end="0:22.102">ラー</span><span begin="0:22.102" end="0:22.292">越</span><span begin="0:22.292" end="0:22.612">し</span><span begin="0:22.612" end="0:22.822">の</span><span begin="0:22.822" end="0:23.752">横</span><span begin="0:23.752" end="0:24.732">顔</span></p><p begin="0:25.019" end="0:26.729" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.019" end="0:25.279">か</span><span begin="0:25.279" end="0:25.489">じ</span><span begin="0:25.489" end="0:25.769">か</span><span begin="0:25.769" end="0:25.989">む</span><span begin="0:25.989" end="0:26.499">指</span><span begin="0:26.499" end="0:26.729">も</span></p><p begin="0:26.961" end="0:28.681" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.961" end="0:27.081">降</spa